        "enabled": true,
        "webSearchEnabled": true,
        "description": "FATF Recommendation 16 (Travel Rule / Wire Transfer Rule), GSMA international transfer guidelines, EAC payments integration, CEMAC payment regulations, AfricaNenda fast payment systems, ECOWAS payment framework"
